# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
# Per-environment data dirs used by scripts/tf.ps1
**/.terraform-*/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Local-only (public repo): state bootstrap + wrapper scripts, and backend
# configs that contain the AWS account ID in the state bucket name
scripts/*.ps1
*.backend.hcl
backend.hcl

# Keep the provider lock file committed
!.terraform.lock.hcl
